# wasm-pack's DISTRIBUTED output is COMMITTED: onion-wasm/pkg-web (explicit
# init, `--target web`) and onion-wasm/pkg-bundler (the default `.` export).
# Consumers install from a GitHub tag, so the built artifacts are in the tree.
# Only scratch builds are ignored — the default out-dir and a node build.
/onion-wasm/pkg
/onion-wasm/pkg-node
tcdocs/
planning/scratch.md

# The root package.json makes this repo installable by npm from a git tag;
# these are what working in it locally leaves behind.
/node_modules
/*.tgz


