# Credentials for corpora/fetch-corpora.sh (see .env.example).
.env

# The calibration tier: ~1500 bibles, 3.2GB raw / ~950MB as per-file .gz. This
# repo is installed by git clone (`npm i github:...#v0.1.0` clones, then packs
# through package.json `files`), so repo weight is a consumer cost. Fetched,
# never carried. The committed corpora/*.txt are the test tier.
/corpora/calibration-corpora/
sous-chef/planning/
